    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Crazy Golf Party Is a new an excited golf game that tries to take the original format of crazy golf and bring it into game format in new and exciting ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <u></u><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524060/extras/1b8dd330a6b2c10b8cdadb705b51bcf4.avif?t=1753510948\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit Our Official Discord For Crusade Developments where you can suggest and give feedback on crazy golf party! (Link In Info Section)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutliplayer!</strong>\u00a0The game features 15 player coop that can be played Online or Lan with you, your friends and family to see who is the best golfer of all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524060/extras/6e63e43c992eb371cc890ecdbf364642.avif?t=1753510948\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Customisation!</strong> There is a variety of hats and skins that you can customise your golf ball to look any way you want from Cool to Goofy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524060/extras/15fe970532e63928924a0f69aff4b889.avif?t=1753510948\" data-has-big width=800 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 5 Exciting Maps To Discover On Release!</strong> We have 5 maps on release, the maps releasing are Funderheim, Elden Forest, Egypt, Windmill Valley &amp; Haunted Hallows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524060/extras/34187aa1018f50fa43e16022818e41f7.avif?t=1753510948\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Themed Maps!</strong>\u00a0Each map in unique and themed so that there is a map for everyone From Egypt to forests filled with strange magic! And Maybe In the Future Maybe To The Sea To Plunder And Pillage?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524060/extras/3a1874ac63106af038c8229e18a5996c.avif?t=1753510948\" data-has-big width=800 height=398 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Crazy Golf Party Is a new an excited golf game that tries to take the original format of crazy golf and bring it into game format in new and exciting ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <u></u><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524060/extras/1b8dd330a6b2c10b8cdadb705b51bcf4.avif?t=1753510948\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit Our Official Discord For Crusade Developments where you can suggest and give feedback on crazy golf party! (Link In Info Section)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutliplayer!</strong>\u00a0The game features 15 player coop that can be played Online or Lan with you, your friends and family to see who is the best golfer of all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524060/extras/6e63e43c992eb371cc890ecdbf364642.avif?t=1753510948\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Customisation!</strong> There is a variety of hats and skins that you can customise your golf ball to look any way you want from Cool to Goofy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524060/extras/15fe970532e63928924a0f69aff4b889.avif?t=1753510948\" data-has-big width=800 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 5 Exciting Maps To Discover On Release!</strong> We have 5 maps on release, the maps releasing are Funderheim, Elden Forest, Egypt, Windmill Valley &amp; Haunted Hallows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524060/extras/34187aa1018f50fa43e16022818e41f7.avif?t=1753510948\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Themed Maps!</strong>\u00a0Each map in unique and themed so that there is a map for everyone From Egypt to forests filled with strange magic! And Maybe In the Future Maybe To The Sea To Plunder And Pillage?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524060/extras/3a1874ac63106af038c8229e18a5996c.avif?t=1753510948\" data-has-big width=800 height=398 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Ever wanted to play Crazy golf from the comfort of your own home.... Well now you can! With 5 Maps To Explore And Complete On Launch! Crazy Golf Party is coming to steam soon and is ideal for casual players that want a fun game to play with friends!",
